<title>USA: Securacom delays initial public offering.</title>
<headline>Securacom delays initial public offering.</headline>
<dateline>WOODCLIFF LAKE, N.J. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Securacom Inc said Thursday it had postponed its offering of common stock until the fall.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it is growing rapidly and financial results are stronger than previously expected.</p>
<p>Securacom is a consulting engineering company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
